tsacformc="">Required</td><td class="cell4" style="padding: 5px; word-break: break-all; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">Proficient in J2EE technologies, with strong working knowledge of JavaScript and JSP</td></tr><tr style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc=""><td class="cell1" style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">&nbsp;</td><td class="cell2" style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">13</td><td class="cell3" style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">Required</td><td class="cell4" style="padding: 5px; word-break: break-all; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">Hands-on skills in Front-End/UI Development, including enhancement and maintenance of enterprise-grade web applications on the J2EE platform</td></tr><tr style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc=""><td class="cell1" style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">&nbsp;</td><td class="cell2" style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">13</td><td class="cell3" style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">Required</td><td class="cell4" style="padding: 5px; word-break: break-all; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">Strong SQL query writing skills for data extraction, transformation, and analysis.</td></tr><tr style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc=""><td class="cell1" style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">&nbsp;</td><td class="cell2" style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">13</td><td class="cell3" style="padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">Required</td><td class="cell4" style="padding: 5px; word-break: break-all; border: 1px solid black;" c-itsacformc_itsacformc="">Experience 